ue unknown posterior. However, this may not be true when inference of \u03b8 is done on a very limited simulation budget. Secondly, we assume that there is no model miss-specification and the observations come from the joint distribution p(x,\u03b8,y) used for learning the IDE. This can be a strong assumption when modelling a new phenomenon."
